error[ffi_layer_unreached]: this group says `layer`, and `hero_os.h` is the runtime's own header, none of the platform layer's, and includes none of them, so nothing it binds is the layer's: take the word out
  at tests/golden/unsupported/layer-a-group-saying-layer-over-the-runtimes-own-header.hero:13:20
     |
  13 | extern "hero_os.h" layer  #~ ffi_layer_unreached
     |                    ^^^^^
  note: the platform layer's members are compiled and linked only for a program whose groups say `layer`; a program none of whose groups says it links nothing of the layer, so its build asks nothing of it; a word that binds nothing makes every program reaching this group pay for the layer
  fix (certain): take `layer` out

